ucabled (0.2.0~) unstable; urgency=medium

  The Debian package is now split into two: ucabled (the system daemon)
  and ucable-agent (the default GTK4 session agent and its helper).
  apt installs ucable-agent automatically through ucabled's Recommends.

  The new optional GNOME Shell extension is packaged separately as
  ucable-gnome-agent.  It replaces ucable-agent on GNOME and stays
  disabled until each user enables it:

      gnome-extensions enable ucable-gnome-agent@fuzy.me

 -- Zhengyi Fu <i@fuzy.me>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:15:19 +0800
